  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/banner.webp\" width=\"1123\" height=\"429\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=7693ef&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"258\" height=\"33\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/aoc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MADE FOR-ALL OF CREATE-393939?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=7693ef&logoColor=white\" width=\"269\" height=\"33\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-393939?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=7693ef&logoColor=white\" width=\"260\" height=\"33\"></a></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>為 FTB Quests 的 create 章節加入類 create 的藍圖主題風格。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\">可在 create_questing.json 設定檔中高度自訂</a>，支援選擇多個章節、調整顏色、大小及其他選項！<br>同時也新增了藍圖物品，功能與任務書相同，但可以合成製作出來，更契合 create 風格主題。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/1.webp\" width=\"1123\" height=\"827\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/2.webp\" width=\"1123\" height=\"446\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/3.webp\" width=\"1119\" height=\"445\"></p>",
